            "number": "01",
            "heading": "Fabric & Craft",
            "body": "<p>We work almost entirely in fluid natural blends: silk-touch georgette, matte crepe, washed linen and cupro linings that breathe in heat. Fabrics are chosen first for how they fall and second for color. Our neutrals are kept to a narrow palette so that pieces bought seasons apart still work together.</p><p>Every style is sampled on more than one height before it goes into production. Nothing is graded by algorithm alone.</p>",
            "link_text": "Shop Dresses",
            "link": "/collections/dresses"
          }
        },
        "c2": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/86E369EC-183E-424C-B664-A9132FCA5A90.jpg",
            "number": "02",
            "heading": "The Atelier",
            "body": "<p>Alongside the collection, our atelier takes a limited number of made-to-measure and bridal commissions each season. These are drafted to your own measurements, with fabric chosen alongside a member of our team, and finished in about four weeks.</p>",
            "link_text": "Book an Appointment",
            "link": "/pages/appointments"
          }
        },
        "c3": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/793C21D1-A7D5-4A86-8294-96708AFFF9DE.jpg",
            "number": "03",
            "heading": "How We Make",
            "body": "<p>We produce in small runs. Styles are cut in batches of forty to eighty rather than thousands, which keeps waste low and lets us quietly retire a silhouette when it stops working.</p><p>We are a small team, and we answer our own messages. If something you bought from us is not right, tell us directly and we will fix it.</p>",
            "link_text": "Client Care",
            "link": "/pages/client-care"
          }
